# Tam, the Possibility: "{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}, {T}: Proliferate X times, where X is the number of planeswalker types among
# planeswalkers you control." Wrenn and Six (type Wrenn) and Oko, Thief of Crowns (type Oko) are two types, so X is two:
# the ability asks twice, and both choices go to Wrenn and Six, whose three loyalty counters become five (CR 701.34a).
# Oko is not chosen, so it stays at four. Tam's own cost reduction paid for Oko's {1}{G}{U} with just {G}{U}. Bot2's
# Island is a permanent somebody else controls, so it is no planeswalker type of yours.

